WEBVTT

00:03.140 --> 00:06.190
Hey now, take your time, boys. 
No need to rush.

00:06.500 --> 00:08.170
But it's really tasty!

00:08.170 --> 00:09.770
Tasty!

00:10.490 --> 00:12.360
Is that so? I'm glad you like it.

00:12.360 --> 00:13.080
Yeah!

00:13.080 --> 00:14.040
Father.

00:14.040 --> 00:15.050
What is it?

00:15.050 --> 00:17.910
How much farther to Astarl Castle?

00:17.910 --> 00:19.670
Well, let's see.

00:19.670 --> 00:21.880
On foot, I'd say about three more days.

00:21.880 --> 00:24.960
I'm really excited to learn 
about another culture.

00:24.960 --> 00:27.510
And I haven't seen Uncle Neil in a long time.

00:27.510 --> 00:30.120
If you call him "uncle," 
he'll get mad at you again.

00:30.120 --> 00:32.090
But why? Isn't he our uncle?

00:32.090 --> 00:34.070
Our uncle!

00:35.520 --> 00:38.100
Let's ask Uncle Neil all about it 
when we see him.

00:38.430 --> 00:41.850
Won't it be difficult to restore a Roman bath?

00:42.250 --> 00:44.710
I can't say for sure until I've seen the site,

00:44.710 --> 00:49.760
but I hear the structure is very old 
and the spring has been blocked off.

00:50.940 --> 00:52.450
Sounds like a fine challenge!

00:52.970 --> 00:54.430
I'm counting on your help.

00:54.430 --> 00:55.950
I want seconds!

00:56.660 --> 00:58.560
You're sure eating like a big boy.

00:58.560 --> 00:59.780
Uh-huh!

00:59.780 --> 01:03.210
This restaurant was a great choice. 
It really is delicious.

01:03.210 --> 01:06.010
I wish we could save some for Mother.

01:06.010 --> 01:08.710
You're right. Let's bring her along next time.

03:19.050 --> 03:21.130
Hold it!

03:21.130 --> 03:22.950
No!

03:22.950 --> 03:24.640
Maria!

03:24.640 --> 03:27.990
Stop that right now!

03:33.480 --> 03:35.840
Hey! What are you doing to Maria?

03:35.840 --> 03:37.050
Please save me!

03:37.050 --> 03:38.470
You better be my shield!

03:38.470 --> 03:41.270
But I detest violence!

03:45.480 --> 03:46.720
Ahem!

03:49.460 --> 03:50.460
Oh.

03:51.690 --> 03:53.960
This will not do!

03:56.510 --> 03:58.090
Have you forgotten already?

03:58.620 --> 04:02.030
Pull the one leg far behind you. 
Even farther.

04:02.030 --> 04:04.600
There is no reason to lower your face.

04:05.460 --> 04:08.100
Um, how long must I stay in this position?

04:08.670 --> 04:14.470
Have you also forgotten what 
I taught you about being diligent?

04:14.470 --> 04:17.170
Oh, how distressing!

04:17.170 --> 04:22.340
To see how slovenly you've become 
after such a short time apart...

04:22.340 --> 04:24.230
I can't take this anymore.

04:24.880 --> 04:27.080
Oh, what a deplorable state of affairs!

04:27.380 --> 04:30.220
When you were twelve, 
you could do this perfectly!

04:42.510 --> 04:45.220
Yikes!

04:47.930 --> 04:49.310
Lyle?

04:49.310 --> 04:50.810
Lady Leticia?

04:51.280 --> 04:53.060
Shh!

04:51.280 --> 04:53.060
Shh!

04:53.060 --> 04:55.330
What are you doing out this late?

04:55.330 --> 04:57.080
Isn't it obvious? I'm escaping.

04:57.080 --> 04:57.990
What?

04:58.570 --> 05:00.990
I'm on my feet all the time too

05:00.990 --> 05:04.550
because I have to send 
status reports to Delbaran.

05:04.550 --> 05:06.810
I didn't realize attendants
had their hands so full.

05:06.810 --> 05:10.850
Do you have any idea what I was 
forced to endure prior to this?

05:10.850 --> 05:15.200
I had to play guinea pig for the prince 
as he practiced professing his love to Maria!

05:15.200 --> 05:16.550
That must have been awful.

05:16.550 --> 05:18.510
And to make matters even worse...

05:18.510 --> 05:21.510
Yeah, I knew it. You're doing it all wrong!

05:21.850 --> 05:24.190
Of course I was!

05:25.310 --> 05:27.220
But what's worrying you, Lady Leticia?

05:27.220 --> 05:29.390
Haven't you been getting along 
with Prince Clarke?

05:29.390 --> 05:32.440
Well, with Prince Clarke, yes.

05:32.440 --> 05:35.150
But now <i>those</i> have started up again...

05:35.150 --> 05:36.360
"Those"?

05:36.670 --> 05:38.530
Princess lessons.

05:38.900 --> 05:41.500
Laila can certainly be a harsh mistress.

05:41.500 --> 05:43.650
Suffering like a never-ending nightmare.

05:43.650 --> 05:45.280
You have any idea what that's like?

05:45.280 --> 05:49.990
Yes. I'm in a similar boat 
because I can't see my beloved.

05:49.990 --> 05:51.770
Oh, so you're in love with someone?

05:52.180 --> 05:57.210
I haven't seen her in ages. 
I can only meet her in my dreams now.

05:58.020 --> 06:00.210
How I long to see her smile again...

06:00.210 --> 06:02.350
Isn't that the saddest thing ever?

06:02.860 --> 06:06.820
I have as much of a right 
to be happy as anyone else!

06:06.820 --> 06:10.360
Of course you do! Everyone should
 be free to live as they please!

06:10.360 --> 06:12.320
I can tell we're on the same page about that!

06:12.320 --> 06:14.830
I must find a way to escape this nightmare!

06:15.830 --> 06:19.440
I want to be the one 
to decide how I live my life!

06:19.710 --> 06:23.710
I want to return to Delbaran and see my love!

06:23.710 --> 06:26.840
I've had it up to here with princess lessons!

06:26.840 --> 06:29.910
I want to sleep in her arms!

06:34.590 --> 06:36.830
Causing such a commotion 
in the middle of the night...

06:36.830 --> 06:38.930
What are you doing, Lettie?

06:39.820 --> 06:42.160
That goes for you too, Lyle.

06:43.240 --> 06:44.730
Are you not the least bit sorry?

06:44.730 --> 06:45.630
Not at all.

06:45.630 --> 06:46.460
Lettie!

06:46.460 --> 06:51.150
My lady, I appreciate your honesty, 
but this is most inappropriate.

06:51.150 --> 06:54.350
We were only trying to escape 
from our nightmares!

06:54.350 --> 06:57.100
There's nothing wrong with that. Right, Lyle?

06:57.100 --> 07:01.480
That's right! We merely 
want to be free! That's all!

07:01.480 --> 07:04.060
I feel so bad for poor Lyle.

07:04.060 --> 07:07.370
I mean, he had to pretend to be Maria
so the prince could practice flirting.

07:07.370 --> 07:11.240
And being forced to listen to endless
 random love poems? Talk about torture!

07:11.240 --> 07:12.160
What?

07:12.160 --> 07:13.120
Blush!

07:13.440 --> 07:18.290
And Lady Leticia was promised that 
her princess lessons were done with!

07:18.290 --> 07:20.130
You cannot blame her for running!

07:20.130 --> 07:22.220
We did not break our deal.

07:22.220 --> 07:25.940
She finished her princess lessons 
and has simply moved on to queen lessons.

07:25.940 --> 07:29.010
That's just semantics! 
She worked tirelessly for ten years,

07:29.010 --> 07:33.020
and just when she thinks it's all over,
she's thrown back in? It's simply too cruel!

07:33.020 --> 07:35.290
That's it, Lyle! I knew you'd understand!

07:35.290 --> 07:37.010
Right?

07:37.010 --> 07:41.580
Lyle hasn't seen his sweetheart in ages,
so he cries into his pillow every night.

07:41.580 --> 07:44.300
You should let him run to her at once!

07:44.300 --> 07:47.060
Lady Leticia, you have such a kind heart!

07:47.060 --> 07:47.770
Right?

07:47.770 --> 07:49.670
We must be free!

07:49.670 --> 07:50.970
Yes, exactly!

07:49.670 --> 07:54.080
Must you keep affirming each 
other's statements over and over?!

07:55.930 --> 07:57.040
Are we?

08:01.740 --> 08:06.570
Leticia Dorman isn't one to relent
just because she's been chewed out!

08:06.570 --> 08:09.960
You just wait and see. 
I'll make you all regret this!

08:11.210 --> 08:11.930
Hmm?

08:20.710 --> 08:22.730
Wuh? Hmm...

08:25.440 --> 08:30.490
Heave ho, here I go!
Heave ho, here I go!

08:34.730 --> 08:36.110
All right!

08:44.040 --> 08:46.060
Okay! Huh?

08:48.540 --> 08:50.550
No way. I'm stuck?

08:50.550 --> 08:51.980
Wuh?!

08:51.980 --> 08:55.310
Don't tell me I'm trapped in a hole!

08:58.960 --> 09:00.040
Ugh...

09:03.200 --> 09:06.960
Lettie, good morning. 
I was thinking about yesterday and...

09:09.640 --> 09:10.770
Lettie?

09:16.320 --> 09:18.200
What's going on? What happened?!

09:18.620 --> 09:21.460
Prince Clarke? Good morning!

09:21.460 --> 09:24.210
What in the world has happened to you?

09:24.520 --> 09:27.600
I found part of the wall 
that had been repaired,

09:27.600 --> 09:31.360
and when I tapped on it, a hole opened up. 
I thought I could squeeze through.

09:31.360 --> 09:34.840
I thought I'd be able to slip
 outside with no trouble.

09:34.840 --> 09:36.180
I see.

09:36.940 --> 09:41.060
Um, anyway, would you mind 
very much helping me get out?

09:41.060 --> 09:43.150
Okay, what should I do?

09:43.150 --> 09:45.530
Please grab my waist and pull me out.

09:45.530 --> 09:50.860
Huh? But to do that, I'd have to put my hands 
all over your adorable rear end, Lettie.

09:50.860 --> 09:53.680
Don't make it sound so weird! 
This is an emergency!

09:53.680 --> 09:54.700
All right!

09:55.050 --> 09:56.940
Okay, Lettie, are you ready?

09:56.940 --> 09:59.210
Yes. Please go ahead.

09:59.210 --> 10:00.700
One, two!

10:01.190 --> 10:02.960
I think you moved a little!

10:02.960 --> 10:04.400
Thank goodness for that!

10:05.140 --> 10:07.670
One more time. One, two!

10:07.670 --> 10:08.940
One, two!

10:08.940 --> 10:10.730
One, two!

10:08.940 --> 10:10.730
One, two!

10:16.020 --> 10:17.750
Lettie? Lettie!

10:20.900 --> 10:22.850
Prince Clarke...

10:22.850 --> 10:24.190
It worked!

10:27.990 --> 10:30.000
Oh! Uh...

10:33.640 --> 10:34.700
Lettie?

10:37.140 --> 10:38.200
Whoa!

10:38.650 --> 10:39.860
Ah! Oh, I know!

10:39.860 --> 10:42.240
We should fetch some hot water 
to help wash off that mud!

10:42.240 --> 10:43.710
Yes, you're right!

10:43.710 --> 10:46.210
I'll ask Maria to heat some up!

10:46.210 --> 10:48.460
Thank you very much!

11:07.290 --> 11:10.780
So yet again, I find myself in a hole.

11:10.780 --> 11:13.910
It's true that I grew lax after my 
princess lessons.

11:13.910 --> 11:18.100
I was just starting to worry that I may have 
put on a bit of weight in the waistline.

11:18.100 --> 11:21.930
Ah, how can I face Prince Clarke 
and the others like this?

11:21.930 --> 11:22.700
Wuh?

11:22.700 --> 11:25.150
Missus, where are you?!

11:25.580 --> 11:26.850
Missus!

11:26.850 --> 11:28.760
Maria, what seems to be the matter?

11:28.760 --> 11:31.350
Miss Lily, the missus appears to be missing.

11:31.350 --> 11:33.650
Oh, how awful!

11:33.650 --> 11:38.680
I wonder if the "stuck in a hole" incident 
from yesterday has anything to do with it.

11:38.680 --> 11:41.430
Ah, yes. I heard about that.

11:41.430 --> 11:44.340
The hole incident must have been 
very traumatizing for her.

11:44.340 --> 11:46.690
It's an incident now!

11:46.690 --> 11:49.620
I'm staying in here for the rest of my life.

11:49.620 --> 11:50.590
Lettie?

11:50.590 --> 11:51.440
Huh?

11:52.480 --> 11:55.970
Lettie, you're here, right? 
It's about time you came out.

11:58.470 --> 11:59.400
Oh?

12:02.570 --> 12:04.370
What a great hiding spot!

12:05.220 --> 12:06.860
So, what are you doing in there?

12:06.860 --> 12:09.370
I'm really embarrassed about yesterday.

12:10.500 --> 12:13.880
Then why don't we go out 
and do something fun for a change?

12:14.140 --> 12:15.100
Wuh?

12:23.320 --> 12:26.480
Oh. What are you waiting for?

12:26.480 --> 12:29.810
You'd better get over here 
while there's still some left!

12:30.480 --> 12:31.610
They finally made it.

12:32.710 --> 12:34.310
Go on, Lettie.

12:59.550 --> 13:02.610
Ah, this is paradise!

13:04.780 --> 13:06.370
Prince Clarke?

13:07.130 --> 13:08.480
What a comfortable spot.

13:10.020 --> 13:11.230
Yes.

13:12.340 --> 13:13.760
Prince Clarke?

13:13.760 --> 13:14.730
Yes?

13:15.070 --> 13:18.240
I think I'm starting to like it here.

13:18.240 --> 13:19.240
Good.

13:22.620 --> 13:26.150
Bonjour, les amants.

13:26.150 --> 13:27.490
Bwuh?!

13:27.490 --> 13:31.210
Oh, I am so sorry for interrupting 
your moment of bliss,

13:31.210 --> 13:35.130
but that little project is finished now, 
so I came to let you know.

13:35.130 --> 13:36.450
What project?

13:37.840 --> 13:42.260
I'd expect nothing less from Astarl Castle's 
conservatory. The architecture is splendid.

13:42.260 --> 13:45.050
Thank you, Dale. So then...

13:45.050 --> 13:47.640
Indeed, it's all ready for use.

13:47.900 --> 13:51.690
We made adjustments that should 
keep it in service for a long time to come.

13:51.690 --> 13:53.100
It was really hard!

13:53.100 --> 13:54.050
Hard!

13:55.350 --> 13:57.610
Thanks, children. You too, Dale.

13:58.140 --> 13:59.830
You know you can count on me.

14:00.200 --> 14:04.110
And Lady Leticia, if you ever find yourself 
in a fix, I would be more than happy to help.

14:04.110 --> 14:08.960
Lord Dale, are you and your wife both 
adventurers? Where else have you traveled?

14:08.960 --> 14:10.880
Have you ever faced any true danger?

14:10.880 --> 14:13.530
Which country has the most delicious food?

14:13.530 --> 14:16.130
Do you boys go on adventures too? 
What are they like?

14:16.130 --> 14:18.000
Really fun!

14:18.000 --> 14:18.880
Fun!

14:18.880 --> 14:20.780
Oh, I'm so jealous!

14:20.780 --> 14:21.770
Now, Lettie...

14:23.280 --> 14:24.920
What a spirited young lady.

14:24.920 --> 14:29.070
Dale renounced his claim 
to the throne to go adventuring

14:29.070 --> 14:32.710
and married a woman he met 
while on his travels.

14:32.710 --> 14:34.450
It is a marvelous story.

14:34.970 --> 14:36.190
I'll fill you in sometime.

14:36.190 --> 14:37.360
Yes, please!

14:38.380 --> 14:42.400
Well then, let's enjoy 
what we have here for today.

14:49.870 --> 14:50.970
Wow!

14:50.970 --> 14:51.870
Lettie.

15:02.690 --> 15:04.690
Brilliant!

15:05.260 --> 15:09.810
Enjoying a Roman bath while taking in 
the greenery of the botanical garden...

15:09.810 --> 15:10.760
Brilliant indeed.

15:11.510 --> 15:13.840
Ah, this feels so nice.

15:13.840 --> 15:19.050
Yeah. Dale's truly skilled 
to recreate this in so much detail.

15:19.050 --> 15:24.060
Hmm-hmm, hmm-hmm!
Swimmy-swimmy! Swim, swim, swim!

15:24.060 --> 15:25.590
Whee! Swim, swim!

15:25.590 --> 15:27.580
Prince Louis's rear end!

15:28.650 --> 15:30.680
A toast to Dale.

15:28.650 --> 15:31.950
Swim, swim, swim! Swim, swim...

15:38.500 --> 15:40.250
Huh? What? What is this?

15:49.150 --> 15:51.550
Prince Clarke, what in the world...?

15:51.550 --> 15:53.770
Nope, nope, nope!

15:53.770 --> 15:54.760
A milou!

15:55.430 --> 15:56.790
A milou?

15:56.790 --> 15:57.940
Aren't those...

16:02.400 --> 16:06.330
Oh, it's so cute! 
What kind of animal is this?

16:06.710 --> 16:10.600
It's an animal native to the Kingdom 
of Delbaran. It's called a milou.

16:10.600 --> 16:12.070
Wow.

16:12.070 --> 16:16.410
The milou is said to be very faithful in love, 
so the people are very fond of it.

16:16.930 --> 16:19.780
They say it's the perfect gift 
for someone dear to you.

16:19.780 --> 16:21.170
I'm sure it is.

16:21.670 --> 16:24.600
Also, doesn't this milou look 
a little bit like you, Lettie?

16:24.600 --> 16:26.030
Like me?

16:26.030 --> 16:29.180
Its eyes are filled with 
love and determination.

16:32.520 --> 16:37.260
You told me people are fond of these 
because they're faithful in love!

16:37.260 --> 16:42.390
And that's the truth! 
But they're also ferocious carnivores.

16:42.390 --> 16:46.630
So I remind you of a ferocious carnivore? 
Is that what you meant?

16:46.630 --> 16:48.740
Is that really the issue here?

16:49.130 --> 16:52.970
Be quiet! You two go back 
to the castle and stay out of sight.

16:52.970 --> 16:55.730
Leticia and Brianna, follow me.

16:57.800 --> 17:00.030
How did that milou get in here?

17:00.030 --> 17:04.150
I suspect it followed the flow 
of the spring water underground,

17:04.150 --> 17:09.070
but there must be a reason it's appeared
 in the middle of Astarl Castle.

17:09.070 --> 17:13.450
Either way, we're unarmed. 
And all we're wearing are these robes.

17:13.840 --> 17:15.210
What about the guards on watch?

17:15.210 --> 17:17.420
I ordered them away from the conservatory.

17:17.420 --> 17:18.360
Huh?

17:18.360 --> 17:19.750
Well, of course I did!

17:19.750 --> 17:23.410
I can't let other people see 
Lettie's bare skin, now can I?

17:23.410 --> 17:24.390
Huh?

17:25.350 --> 17:26.270
We should regroup.

17:26.270 --> 17:27.280
All right.

17:27.640 --> 17:28.600
Louis!

17:41.240 --> 17:42.940
Please stay back, Prince Louis.

17:42.940 --> 17:43.670
'Kay!

17:43.670 --> 17:45.920
Is everyone all right?!

17:45.920 --> 17:47.840
We brought swords!

17:47.840 --> 17:48.920
They're heavy!

17:48.920 --> 17:50.040
Dale!

17:50.490 --> 17:55.180
Keep your voice down. If we provoke it 
any further, it might go berserk.

17:56.380 --> 17:58.560
No, no! I don't want to be eaten!

17:58.560 --> 18:02.780
I'm not married yet! I haven't paid 
Papa and Mama's loans off yet!

18:02.780 --> 18:05.870
There's still so much I want to do in life!

18:05.870 --> 18:08.950
Hey, isn't the milou acting kind of strange?

18:08.950 --> 18:10.690
What? How do you mean?

18:10.690 --> 18:15.590
It isn't trying to attack us. 
It looks like it's searching for something.

18:15.590 --> 18:18.410
In a conservatory? What could it be?

18:18.730 --> 18:22.290
My lady! Lady Brianna! 
Are you two all right?

18:22.290 --> 18:27.670
Lily! We're okay for the moment, 
but the milou is acting rather odd.

18:28.060 --> 18:30.210
Like it's searching...

18:31.860 --> 18:33.840
For that!

18:37.280 --> 18:38.580
Here it comes.

18:38.580 --> 18:40.320
I'll go first.

18:40.320 --> 18:41.270
All right.

18:44.540 --> 18:47.020
Come on!

18:47.490 --> 18:49.190
You must not strike!

19:09.240 --> 19:12.570
Let's give it back. Is that all right?

19:14.000 --> 19:15.030
Yeah.

19:15.690 --> 19:18.960
We deeply apologize 
for the concern we have caused.

19:18.960 --> 19:21.510
We shall return your child to you.

19:24.860 --> 19:27.440
Bye-bye! Let's play again, okay?

19:34.950 --> 19:36.150
What was that?

19:37.990 --> 19:39.160
Did you have fun?

19:39.160 --> 19:41.280
Yes, I really did.

19:41.280 --> 19:42.290
I'm glad.

19:42.790 --> 19:45.850
Thank you for such a lovely day.

19:46.220 --> 19:49.210
Just stop hiding underneath the floor, okay?

19:49.210 --> 19:50.730
A-All right.

19:50.730 --> 19:52.600
Lady Leticia Dorman?

19:54.940 --> 19:56.050
Prince Clarke.

19:56.050 --> 19:57.550
Madam Laila.

19:57.860 --> 20:02.060
Lady Leticia, are you feeling fully refreshed?

20:02.060 --> 20:03.610
Yes.

20:03.610 --> 20:06.780
Then please make sure 
that you are on time tomorrow.

20:07.340 --> 20:08.810
Headmistress Laila!

20:09.560 --> 20:10.700
Yes?

20:10.700 --> 20:14.620
Um, I would like to plant 
a selection of seasonal flowers

20:14.620 --> 20:18.360
and build a garden where people 
can interact with animals.

20:18.360 --> 20:21.020
A place that everyone would enjoy.

20:21.020 --> 20:23.460
But I have so many questions 
about how to do it, so...

20:23.460 --> 20:28.770
if possible, I'd like to ask you to teach me 
more than just princess lessons, mistress.

20:28.770 --> 20:31.290
Only if it's not an imposition, of course.

20:31.290 --> 20:33.550
I am not a gardener.

20:33.550 --> 20:36.640
Ah, of course. I apologize.

20:36.640 --> 20:40.330
Nevertheless, as long as 
it falls outside of our lesson time,

20:40.330 --> 20:44.010
there are certain things 
that I believe I could teach you.

20:45.100 --> 20:46.770
Thank you very much!

20:46.770 --> 20:48.610
I will look forward to it.

20:48.610 --> 20:49.810
As will I!

20:54.730 --> 20:57.890
Sounds like today was a mess.

20:57.890 --> 21:00.500
Yeah. Sure was, Brother.

21:00.500 --> 21:05.240
But I fell in love with Maria all over again 
when I saw her acting so bravely.

21:05.700 --> 21:07.250
What are you doing?

21:07.250 --> 21:09.760
Huh? Shut your trap, man.

21:09.760 --> 21:13.330
This is only a footbath. 
I wish you would use it properly!

21:13.330 --> 21:16.280
But this way is so much more relaxing.

21:16.280 --> 21:20.280
Not to mention that this is the traditional 
bathing style of the Delbaran royal family.

21:20.280 --> 21:21.810
Is it really?

21:21.810 --> 21:23.120
Yeah, it is.

21:23.120 --> 21:25.010
I find that hard to believe.

21:25.550 --> 21:29.520
Louis, you've gotten pretty good 
at floating, haven't you?

21:29.520 --> 21:32.610
It's all thanks to your 
wonderful instruction, Brother.

21:32.610 --> 21:36.890
All right, then. Shall we have a contest 
to see who can hold their breath longer?

21:36.890 --> 21:38.420
You took the words out of my mouth!

21:38.420 --> 21:40.530
Lyle, you be the judge!

21:40.530 --> 21:44.790
Fine, fine. Get ready... Start.

21:47.470 --> 21:50.000
These idiot brothers!

23:19.960 --> 23:40.110
<b>Next Time</b>

23:20.090 --> 23:25.090
I overslept!

23:20.960 --> 23:25.970
In other words, you <i>do</i> like Clarke?

23:21.960 --> 23:26.970
With the windows barred up?

23:22.960 --> 23:27.970
I wonder what "love" is anyway

23:23.970 --> 23:28.970
You aren't a very good liar, are you?

23:25.970 --> 23:30.970
Really? It truly never lasts? Are you sure?

23:27.340 --> 23:32.350
Have you ever slept in a tree? It's great!

23:28.850 --> 23:33.850
I was sure you'd catch me the next time

23:30.350 --> 23:35.350
I don't dislike it

23:31.850 --> 23:36.850
Please answer me

23:37.310 --> 23:39.980
Love. Love! Love? Love...
